"title": "拉海‧萊 （Lahai-Roi）",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "拉海萊 LahaiRoi",
"language": "zht",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<h1>拉海‧萊（Lahai-Roi）</h1><p>這是某英文譯本對庇耳‧拉海‧萊（Beer-lahai-roi）的拼寫形式。這個名稱指的是一口井，記載於<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01024062\" data-end-ref=\"01024062\">創世記二十四章62節</data>和<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01025011\" data-end-ref=\"01025011\">二十五章11節</data>。</p><p><em>見 </em><data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"3236\" data-resource-code=\"AquiferOpenBibleDictionary\">庇耳‧拉海‧萊</data>。</p>",
