"title": "拉沙",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "拉沙",
"language": "zht",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<h1>拉沙</h1><p>一個地名，除此之外沒有其它資訊。在一段古老的記載中，它被用來指示迦南人所居之地的南界（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01010019\" data-end-ref=\"01010019\">創10:19</data>）。該處經文將拉沙與死海南端附近的其它城邑並列。</p>",
"associations": {
"passage": [
{
"start_ref": "01010019",
"start_ref_usfm": "GEN 10:19",
"end_ref": "01010019",
"end_ref_usfm": "GEN 10:19"
}
],
