"title": "拉吳",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "拉吳",
"language": "zht",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<h1>拉吳</h1><p>法勒的兒子，西鹿的父親。他是閃的後裔（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01011018\" data-end-ref=\"01011021\">創11:18–21</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"13001025\" data-end-ref=\"13001025\">代上1:25</data>）。他在<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"42003035\" data-end-ref=\"42003035\">路加福音三章35節</data>中被列為耶穌的祖先之一。</p><p><em>見</em><data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"4580\" data-resource-code=\"AquiferOpenBibleDictionary\">耶穌基督的家譜</data>。</p>",
"associations": {
